  "source_review": {
    "review": "Actual tensor entries, unfoldings, cut ranks, contractions, lifts and merge maps are transported by explicit linear equivalences. Completion requires actual SVD and child Completion responses; its constructors contain no assumed correctness guarantee. The ordinary comparator bound and attained-sInf-optimum estimate hold for every response. The projected estimate allows every supplied orthonormal first frame; exact zero follows from the actual squared error.",
